1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 10=

10
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,300
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

11
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,560
The ledger of the flood relief
embezzlement is here.

12
00:00:55,030 --> 00:00:56,030
Once this comes to light,

13
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,670
the alliance between Prince Qi
and the Qi family

14
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:58,920
will fall apart on its own.

15
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,280
My condition is simple.

16
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,670
When the truth is exposed,

17
00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:05,760
you must keep the Qi family safe.

18
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:25,940
(Detailed Grain Price Records)

19
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:27,020
(Suspicious Expenditure Items)

20
00:01:28,510 --> 00:01:30,510
Why are you so determined
to bring down Prince Qi?

21
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:34,480
You'd even stake
your entire family's future on it.

22
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,680
Did the two of you...

23
00:01:37,610 --> 00:01:38,640
We have a personal grudge.

24
00:01:39,050 --> 00:01:39,950
Nothing worth mentioning.

25
00:01:40,070 --> 00:01:40,840
What grudge?

26
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,120
I'd rather not say.

27
00:01:44,510 --> 00:01:45,640
If you don't wish to tell me,

28
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,480
I won't press.

29
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,790
But Prince Qi's influence runs deep.

30
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,570
His maternal relatives, the Liu family,

31
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:53,680
and the Zhou family,
headed by Grand Preceptor Zhou,

32
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,560
all stand behind him.

33
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,590
Even my father avoids
confronting him head-on.

34
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,480
What makes you think
you can bring him down?

35
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,560
I have my leverage.

36
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:08,310
The money is stored
at Baotong Money House.

37
00:02:08,870 --> 00:02:10,240
Take your men and seize it.

38
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:13,080
You must act quickly.

39
00:02:13,190 --> 00:02:14,910
I suspect Prince Qi has also been reborn.

40
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,820
Wouldn't that make him
even harder to deal with?

41
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,000
So,

42
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:21,590
do you still wish to work with me,
Your Highness?

43
00:02:29,310 --> 00:02:32,000
Then let's begin with
Princess Consort Qi's return.

44
00:02:36,820 --> 00:02:38,420
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

45
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:40,560
Yue'e,

46
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,680
why are you back?

47
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,400
How dare you!

48
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:44,000
Bow before Her Highness!

49
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:46,520
Forgive us, Your Highness.

50
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:50,590
His Highness has a message.

51
00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:52,990
Regarding what happened
during the welcome ceremony,

52
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,430
if Qi Yuan enters the manor
as a secondary consort

53
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,360
alongside me,

54
00:02:58,570 --> 00:02:59,750
His Highness
will let bygones be bygones.

55
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,120
Otherwise,

56
00:03:02,430 --> 00:03:05,400
the Qi family will become his enemy.

57
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,870
Your Lordship,
consider your answer carefully.

58
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:11,870
Qi Yuan's marriage
is already beyond her station.

59
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:12,910
I've made my decision.

60
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:16,520
Tomorrow, both princess consorts
will leave this house.

61
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,150
It's my marriage.

62
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:20,840
Shouldn't you discuss it with me?

63
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,080
What's there to discuss?

64
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:25,240
It should be decided by parents.

65
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:26,870
Would you defy your elders?

66
00:03:26,870 --> 00:03:28,360
Prince Jing will never agree.

67
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,680
What nonsense.

68
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,960
Whom the Qi family marries off

69
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:31,710
is none of his concern.

70
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:33,350
I've given him the disaster relief ledger.

71
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,120
Are you trying to ruin
the entire Qi family?

72
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:35,960
Qi Zhen!

73
00:03:39,750 --> 00:03:40,470
Yuan,

74
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,960
what are you trying to say?

75
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:44,800
Grandfather, you should know

76
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,680
Prince Qi's character better than I do.

77
00:03:47,230 --> 00:03:49,080
Once the hare is caught,
the hounds are killed.

78
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,560
Though the Qi family
is useful to him now,

79
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,630
one day we'll be the first

80
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:55,400
to be made scapegoats.

81
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,750
Rather than sit here awaiting our fate,

82
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:58,030
we should serve a wiser ruler.

83
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,310
How is that possible?

84
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,150
If we side with Prince Jing,

85
00:04:03,150 --> 00:04:04,870
how could Prince Qi ever spare us?

86
00:04:05,150 --> 00:04:07,520
The Qi family will reach
the end of the road.

87
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,800
Then kill Prince Qi.

88
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,030
Have you lost your mind?

89
00:04:10,030 --> 00:04:11,240
Enough!

90
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:14,840
Yuan,

91
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,750
Prince Jing is known for his integrity.

92
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:20,510
Will he accept the Qi family?

93
00:04:20,870 --> 00:04:21,800
An upright ruler

94
00:04:22,270 --> 00:04:23,720
still needs capable allies.

95
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:26,560
Young Lady,

96
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,950
His Highness has seized the stolen silver
at Baotong Money House.

97
00:04:29,010 --> 00:04:30,630
Tomorrow, he will memorialize His Majesty.

98
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,200
His Highness asks that you rest easy.

99
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,750
Inform Prince Jing

100
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:36,560
that if Prince Qi makes a move,

101
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,870
I'll delay him

102
00:04:37,870 --> 00:04:38,950
and buy His Highness time.

103
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:40,310
Yes, Young Lady.

104
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:43,160
It seems someone has chosen

105
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:46,000
the path for us.

106
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:53,900
(Geng)

107
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:55,920
Your Highness,

108
00:04:56,010 --> 00:04:57,160
a letter from the Qi family.

109
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:59,190
(To Prince Qi)
They must be begging for mercy.

110
00:05:05,940 --> 00:05:07,740
(Get lost)

111
00:05:07,950 --> 00:05:08,800
Scoundrel!

112
00:05:09,750 --> 00:05:12,360
Tomorrow, I marry Han Yue'e.

113
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:17,830
Take a gift to the Qi family.

114
00:05:42,820 --> 00:05:46,460
(Mingyue Pavilion)

115
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,190
Of all places to die,

116
00:05:50,190 --> 00:05:51,160
why here?

117
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,040
Your Highness,

118
00:05:54,310 --> 00:05:55,560
Her Highness said

119
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,390
she wished to depart
from Mingyue Pavilion.

120
00:06:01,390 --> 00:06:02,160
Your Highness.

121
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,630
Greetings, Your Highness.

122
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:05,160
Yuan hasn't gotten up yet.

123
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,800
Please wait outside.

124
00:06:07,270 --> 00:06:07,830
Your Highness.

125
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,510
Step aside.

126
00:06:08,510 --> 00:06:09,560
Please wait a moment.

127
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,160
Move!

128
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:11,510
Your Highness!

129
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:14,360
Your Highness!

130
00:06:21,420 --> 00:06:22,610
Where is the Princess Consort?

131
00:06:24,310 --> 00:06:25,750
Yue'e belongs to Your Highness now.

132
00:06:26,390 --> 00:06:28,630
Has she had second thoughts

133
00:06:28,770 --> 00:06:29,630
and fled the wedding?

134
00:06:29,630 --> 00:06:31,040
Do you think hiding her will help?

135
00:06:32,950 --> 00:06:34,160
What's he talking about?

136
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:36,040
I have no idea.

137
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,360
Zhuque.

138
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:37,990
Yes, Your Highness.

139
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,760
Even if you must dig
three feet underground,

140
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,480
find the Princess Consort.

141
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,120
Yes, Your Highness.

142
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,000
(Mingyue Pavilion)
Why are you so certain

143
00:06:49,430 --> 00:06:51,720
the Princess Consort is here?

144
00:06:52,750 --> 00:06:53,630
Your Highness,

145
00:06:54,010 --> 00:06:55,720
I personally escorted
the Princess Consort

146
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,300
to Young Lady Qi's chamber last night.

147
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,920
She has not returned.

148
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,390
You saw it yourself?

149
00:07:00,390 --> 00:07:01,270
Without a doubt.

150
00:07:01,510 --> 00:07:03,480
She walked past that peony screen

151
00:07:03,530 --> 00:07:04,430
into the inner chamber.

152
00:07:04,430 --> 00:07:05,120
That screen

153
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,900
is a double-sided embroidery
from Jiangnan.

154
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,510
It arrived only this morning.

155
00:07:08,510 --> 00:07:10,360
How could you have seen it last night?

156
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:11,560
I...

157
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,240
Leave us.

158
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:14,270
Yes.

159
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,160
Your Highness,

160
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,120
we've found her.

161
00:07:18,510 --> 00:07:19,480
The Princess Consort...

162
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,800
How is she?

163
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,870
Her Highness is dead.

164
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,040
Your Highness,

165
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,720
my condolences.

166
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:35,160
Qi Yuan,

167
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,680
give it up.

168
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,720
If you wish to clear your name,

169
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:40,920
your only choice is to marry me.

170
00:07:41,630 --> 00:07:43,560
The real show has only just begun.

171
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:45,950
Don't celebrate too soon.

172
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:51,160
Your Highness.

173
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:55,870
This

174
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:59,360
is Bingzhan Grass
used to kill the Princess Consort.

175
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:01,160
It was found in your chamber.

176
00:08:02,190 --> 00:08:03,830
The evidence is conclusive.

177
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,750
What do you have to say?

178
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:07,510
Your Highness,

179
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:08,630
urgent news.

180
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,950
Baotong Money House has been seized
by Prince Jing.

181
00:08:13,430 --> 00:08:15,720
You told Xiao Yunting

182
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,950
where the relief funds were hidden?

183
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,480
Once this case is exposed,

184
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:21,510
the Qi family will not escape blame.

185
00:08:22,310 --> 00:08:24,400
Whether the relief fund scandal
has anything to do

186
00:08:24,410 --> 00:08:25,680
with the Qi family

187
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,600
will be clear enough

188
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,680
once Prince Jing reveals the list.

189
00:08:29,070 --> 00:08:30,190
Your Highness,

190
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:32,030
why the panic?

191
00:08:33,030 --> 00:08:34,670
After the way Xiao Yunting treated you,

192
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:37,150
you still chose to side with him?

193
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:38,550
What is that to you?

194
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,320
Tell my dear nephew

195
00:08:56,030 --> 00:08:57,360
Qi Yuan is in my hands.

196
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,600
Bring the ledger to my residence

197
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,150
to trade her back.

198
00:09:01,750 --> 00:09:04,630
Otherwise, what becomes
of the owner of this hairpin,

199
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,630
I can't say.

200
00:09:11,270 --> 00:09:12,910
Today is Prince Qi's wedding day.

201
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:15,750
His Highness sent you this gift.

202
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,630
Tell my uncle

203
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,510
I thank him for his thoughtfulness.

204
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:21,670
One moment, Your Highness.

205
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,240
His Highness

206
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,630
picked this gift himself.

207
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,390
You should take a look.

208
00:09:56,530 --> 00:10:01,170
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

209
00:10:01,550 --> 00:10:05,330
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

210
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:11,300
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

211
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:15,680
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

212
00:10:16,470 --> 00:10:20,750
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

213
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:28,450
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
